sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Movil
    participant K as kcd
    participant B as kcd_backend
    participant P as PII
    participant D as SQLite
    participant A as MCP tools
    M->>K: SMS / notificacion / llamada (TLS)
    K-->>B: watch NDJSON
    B->>P: redact(title/body/sender/contact/meta)
    P-->>B: redactado + informe
    B->>D: INSERT redactado + HMAC dedup
    A->>D: get_activity / search / get_conversation
    D-->>A: solo redactado
